{"node_id": "nd003", "text": "to find meaning", "depth": 3, "parent_id": "nd002", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.7, "confidence_raw": 0.7, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "It's okay, I've been helping out with some donations lately. Helps take my mind off things.", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 100}, {"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "The donations feel good, you know? Like maybe I'm doing something right.", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 109}, {"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "Sometimes it feels like it's not enough, but every little bit helps.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 68}, {"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "That reminds me of the families I've seen struggling. It's hard not to feel like there's more I could be doing.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 111}, {"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "I remember one time she shared how a small act of kindness from a stranger changed their life.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 94}, {"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "I remember one time she shared how a small act of kindness from a stranger changed their life. It made me realize even small things can make a big impact.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 154}, {"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I keep thinking I could do more to help people in need.", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 79}, {"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It’s just hard sometimes. I saw a family last week with hardly anything for their kids. Feels like I’m not doing enough.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 120}, {"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But sometimes I wonder if my efforts really make a difference.", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 126}, {"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Sometimes I feel like even if I help one family, there are so many more in need. It’s overwhelming.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 99}, {"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I keep thinking there's more I could be doing, you know?", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 80}, {"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Saw a family the other day without proper clothes for their kids. Feels like I'm not doing enough.", "char_start": 81, "char_end": 179}, {"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things have been tough. I keep thinking there's more I could be doing, you know?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 80}, {"session_id": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "I've been trying to focus on the small wins, but it still feels insufficient sometimes. I guess I need to remember every little bit helps.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 138}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261008T125447Z", "last_updated_at": "20261008T130311Z", "first_seen_session": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000723-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 3}
